Give me a hard copy right there.

395
00:46:24,705 --> 00:46:26,290
Fish?

396
00:46:41,638 --> 00:46:44,641
I think it was manufactured locally.

397
00:46:49,229 --> 00:46:53,900
Finest quality. Superior workmanship.

398
00:46:54,735 --> 00:46:57,154
