399
00:46:57,321 --> 00:47:03,827
9906947-XB71.

400
00:47:04,494 --> 00:47:05,829
Interesting.

401
00:47:06,913 --> 00:47:10,834
Not fish. Snake scale.

402
00:47:11,001 --> 00:47:12,419
Snake.

403
00:47:12,627 --> 00:47:17,257
Try Abdul Ben Hassan.
He make this snake!

404
00:48:18,985 --> 00:48:20,695
Abdul Hassan?

405
00:48:21,738 --> 00:48:25,158
I'm a police officer.
I'd like to ask you a few questions.

406
00:48:25,325 --> 00:48:28,370
Artificial-snake license XB71,
that's you?

407
00:48:29,371 --> 00:48:32,207
This is your work, huh?
Who did you sell it to?

408
00:48:32,374 --> 00:48:35,085
My work? Not too many
could afford such quality.

409
00:48:35,252 --> 00:48:36,378
How many?

410
00:48:36,545 --> 00:48:38,755
- Very few.
- How few?

411
00:48:38,964 --> 00:48:40,590
- Look, my friend...
- Taffey Lewis'.

412
00:48:40,757 --> 00:48:44,302
Down in Fourth Sector, Chinatown.

413
00:48:45,303 --> 00:48:49,599
<i>Cross now. Cross now. Cross now.</i>

414
