All the time, pal.

423
00:49:48,575 --> 00:49:49,910
You ever see this girl, huh?

424
00:49:51,411 --> 00:49:52,871
Never seen her. Buzz off.

425
00:49:53,038 --> 00:49:54,915
Your licenses in order, pal?

426
00:49:55,665 --> 00:49:57,167
Hey, Louie.

427
00:49:57,334 --> 00:50:01,922
The man is dry. Give him one
on the house, okay? See?

428
00:50:44,297 --> 00:50:45,966
<i>Hello?</i>

429
00:50:47,842 --> 00:50:51,471
I've had people walk out on me before,
but not when...

430
00:50:51,638 --> 00:50:53,807
...I was being so charming.

431
00:50:54,015 --> 00:50:58,103
I'm in a bar, here now,
down in the Fourth Sector.

432
00:50:59,187 --> 00:51:00,647
Taffey Lewis is on the line.

433
00:51:00,814 --> 00:51:03,984
Why don't you come on down here
and have a drink?

434
00:51:04,150 --> 00:51:06,695
<i>I don't think so, Mr. Deckard.</i>

435
00:51:07,904 --> 00:51:09,239
<i>That's not my kind of place.</i>

436
00:51:09,906 --> 00:51:10,991
Go someplace else?

437
00:51:26,881 --> 00:51:29,426
<i>Ladies and gentlemen...</i>

438
00:51:29,634 --> 00:51:34,848
<i>...Taffey Lewis presents
Miss Salome and the snake.</i>

439
00:51:35,015 --> 00:51:39,394
<i>Watch her take the pleasure
from the serpent...</i>

440
00:51:39,561 --> 00:51:43,356
<i>...that once corrupted man.</i>

441
00:52:25,565 --> 00:52:28,276
Excuse me, Miss Salome,
can I talk to you for a minute?

442
00:52:28,443 --> 00:52:32,572
I'm from the American Federation
of Variety Artists.

443
00:52:32,739 --> 00:52:33,782
Oh, yeah?

444
00:52:33,948 --> 00:52:37,744
I'm not here to make you join.
No, ma'am. That's not my department.

445
00:52:37,911 --> 00:52:39,788
Actually...

446
00:52:41,956 --> 00:52:46,419
...I'm from the Confidential Committee
on Moral Abuses.

447
00:52:47,337 --> 00:52:49,172
Committee of Moral Abuses?

448
00:52:49,339 --> 00:52:51,508
There's been reports
that the management...

449
00:52:51,716 --> 00:52:53,843
...has been taking liberties
with the artists.

450
00:52:54,010 --> 00:52:55,470
I don't know nothing about it.

451
00:52:55,637 --> 00:52:58,640
Have you felt yourself to be
exploited in any way?

452
00:52:58,807 --> 00:53:01,267
How do you mean "exploited"?

453
00:53:01,434 --> 00:53:03,978
Well, like to get this job.

454
00:53:04,145 --> 00:53:09,109
I mean, did you do, or were you
asked to do, anything that's...

455
00:53:09,275 --> 00:53:11,444
...lewd or unsavory or...

456
00:53:11,611 --> 00:53:15,490
...otherwise repulsive
to your person, huh?

457
00:53:18,535 --> 00:53:21,121
- Are you for real?
- Oh, yeah.

458
00:53:21,287 --> 00:53:24,499
I'd like to check
your dressing room, if I may.

459
00:53:24,666 --> 00:53:27,377
- For what?
- For holes.

460
00:53:27,544 --> 00:53:28,628
Holes?

461
00:53:28,795 --> 00:53:31,548
Well, you'd be surprised
what a guy would go through...

462
00:53:31,756 --> 00:53:34,551
...to get a glimpse of a beautiful body.

463
00:53:37,762 --> 00:53:38,847
No, I wouldn't.

464
00:53:39,013 --> 00:53:41,141
Little...

465
00:53:41,307 --> 00:53:46,813
...dirty holes they drill in the wall
so they can watch a lady undress.

466
00:54:20,180 --> 00:54:23,475
- Is this a real snake?
- Of course it's not real.

467
00:54:23,641 --> 00:54:27,812
Think I'd be working in a place like this
if I could afford a real snake?

468
00:54:41,868 --> 00:54:44,871
So if somebody does try to exploit me,
who do I go to about it?

469
00:54:45,038 --> 00:54:49,209
- Me.
- You're a dedicated man. Dry me.

470
00:55:15,610 --> 00:55:17,403
The only thing they care about...

471
00:55:17,570 --> 00:55:18,780
Hey!

472
00:56:45,491 --> 00:56:48,202
<i>Cross now. Cross now.</i>

473
