<i>Don't walk. Don't walk.</i>

478
00:57:04,010 --> 00:57:06,095
<i>Don't walk. Don't walk.</i>

479
00:57:06,262 --> 00:57:09,349
<i>Don't walk. Don't walk. Don't walk.</i>

480
00:57:24,030 --> 00:57:27,158
<i>Cross now. Cross now.</i>

481
00:57:27,492 --> 00:57:30,244
<i>Cross now. Cross now.</i>

482
00:57:30,411 --> 00:57:32,705
<i>Cross now. Cross now.</i>

483
00:57:33,373 --> 00:57:36,376
<i>Cross now. Cross now.</i>

484
00:57:36,542 --> 00:57:38,127
<i>Cross now. Cross now.</i>

485
00:57:38,294 --> 00:57:40,129
Move! Get out of the way!

486
00:59:26,486 --> 00:59:28,029
Deckard.

487
00:59:28,196 --> 00:59:29,822
B26354.

488
00:59:36,329 --> 00:59:38,998
<i>Move on. Move on.</i>

489
00:59:39,165 --> 00:59:41,459
<i>Move on. Move on.</i>

490
00:59:41,626 --> 00:59:44,879
<i>Move on. Move on.</i>

491
00:59:50,510 --> 00:59:52,220
A minute.

492
00:59:54,514 --> 00:59:56,015
Yeah, what do you want?

493
00:59:56,182 --> 00:59:58,017
Tsingtao.

494
01:00:05,191 --> 01:00:07,068
This enough?

495
01:00:07,235 --> 01:00:08,736
Yeah.

496
01:00:17,411 --> 01:00:19,247
Bryant.

497
01:00:39,183 --> 01:00:43,104
Christ, Deckard, you look almost as bad
as that skin-job you left on the sidewalk.

498
01:00:43,271 --> 01:00:44,564
I'm going home.

499
01:00:44,730 --> 01:00:46,607
Could learn from this guy, Gaff.

500
01:00:46,774 --> 01:00:49,569
He's a goddamn one-man
slaughterhouse, that's what he is.

501
01:00:50,403 --> 01:00:52,113
Four more to go.

502
01:00:52,280 --> 01:00:54,073
- Come on, Gaff, let's go.
- Three.

503
01:00:56,325 --> 01:00:57,493
There's three to go.

504
01:00:58,119 --> 01:01:00,413
There's four.

505
01:01:00,580 --> 01:01:03,374
That skin-job you VK'd
at the Tyrell Corporation...

506
01:01:03,541 --> 01:01:07,420
...Rachael, disappeared, vanished.
Didn't even know she was a Replicant.

507
01:01:07,587 --> 01:01:10,423
Something to do with a brain implant,
says Tyrell.

508
01:01:10,590 --> 01:01:13,968
Come on, Gaff.
Drink some for me, huh, pal?

509
